{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2019-10-11 10:30:00', 'title': 'IAC CONVEYED TO MATCH GROUP BOARD, A PRELIM. PROPOSAL FOR DEAL THAT WOULD RESULT IN SEPARATION OF MATCH GROUP FROM REMAINING BUSINESSES OF IAC', 'text': 'IAC - CONVEYED TO MATCH GROUP BOARD, A PRELIM. PROPOSAL FOR DEAL THAT WOULD RESULT IN SEPARATION OF MATCH GROUP FROM REMAINING BUSINESSES OF IAC.IAC - PROPOSED SEPARATION TRANSACTION WOULD RESULT IN TWO INDEPENDENT PUBLIC COMPANIES, REFERRED TO HEREIN AS “NEW MATCH” AND “NEW IAC.”.IAC -  IAC WOULD NO LONGER HAVE AN OWNERSHIP STAKE IN MATCH GROUP FOLLOWING THE SEPARATION.IAC -  IAC STOCKHOLDERS WOULD RECEIVE SHARES OF BOTH NEW MATCH AND NEW IAC IN TRANSACTION.IAC - TRANSACTION WOULD BE STRUCTURED TO BE TAX-FREE TO IAC, MATCH GROUP AND THEIR RESPECTIVE STOCKHOLDERS.IAC - TRANSACTION WOULD ALSO ELIMINATE DUAL-CLASS COMMON STOCK STRUCTURE AT NEW MATCH.IAC - PRE-TRANSACTION STOCKHOLDERS OF IAC WOULD RECEIVE STOCK IN NEW IAC REPLICATING THEIR CURRENT INTEREST IN IAC.IAC - NEW MATCH WOULD BECOME RESPONSIBLE FOR SPECIFIED LIABILITIES OF IAC AND RETAIN CERTAIN REAL ESTATE ASSETS CURRENTLY OWNED BY IAC.IAC - PRIOR TO SEPARATION, MATCH GROUP WOULD CONSUMMATE CERTAIN DEBT FINANCING TRANSACTIONS.IAC - PROPOSAL CONTEMPLATES THAT, PRIOR TO SEPARATION, IAC MAY SELL SECURITIES REPRESENTING POST-TRANSACTION EQUITY INTEREST SOLELY IN NEW MATCH.IAC - INFORMED MATCH GROUP THAT IAC’S WILLINGNESS TO PROCEED WITH ANY SEPARATION TRANSACTION IS CONDITIONED UPON APPROVAL OF IAC BOARD OF DIRECTORS.IAC - IAC EXPECTS THAT THERE MAY BE ADDITIONAL DISCUSSIONS AMONG PARTIES REGARDING POTENTIAL SEPARATION OF MATCH GROUP AND RELATED MATTERS.'}